  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "fire sequential shots at frontal enemies, stunning each",
    "skill1": "normal attacks deal AoE damage",
    "skill2": "prioritize attacking highest-damage-dealt enemy, gaining a buff",
    "skill3": "battle crit damage boost",
    "skill4": "throw grenades at battle start, dealing AoE damage and stunning enemies",
    "skill5": "gain a shield on first hit against the marked target"
  },
  "play_overview": "Walker fires **sequential frontal shots** that stun each target hit, and his normal attacks deal **AoE damage** for spread pressure. He **prioritizes the highest-damage-dealt enemy**, gaining a buff on focus, and throws **grenades at battle start** for AoE damage and stun. Battle **crit damage growth** adds scaling over time, and first hit against the marked target grants a shield for survivability. He excels as a **battle-start burst specialist** with sustained stun pressure on priority targets. Against **stun-immune targets** or lines that deny his opening grenade angles, his control chain stalls early.",
  "counter_overview": "Walker's Arena threat is **battle-start grenades** that stun and shred Phys DEF, then a **fast Six-Shot ultimate** that keeps stunning while he later **bounties your top damage dealer**. The opening stun chain decides whether your carry ever acts. Blunt Six-Shot with [[Lily May]], delete him early with high-damage melee like [[Shakir]] or [[Himmel]] before the bounty locks, and [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Evie]] or [[Nerion]] on the marked carry while you race your own ([[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]], [[Hugin]], or [[Rowan]])."
